<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">????</para>
  <para style="toc1">????</para>
  <para style="toc2">????</para>
  <para style="toc3">????</para>
  <para style="mt">????</para>
  <para style="ip">d- Lamma Nkɔng Yakubu, Ɗalapa jawɛrɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi: Geewɔ nyatɛ kpai sẽkoo shɛ a Sẽko gbete au shɛ a Yakubu naayɛ pɛ ruuba tolinɛ nya kosinɛ gbete shɔ beeri &lt;&lt;shɔ Ɗa gnnɛyi gbete shɔ sãtiyi a koo piti kpai&gt;&gt;. Shɔ vi beenɛu shovi a nyanwanɛ a tette ruuɓusinɛ u tɛsi shɔ nɔvi tasinɛ aruu nya kosinɛ ayuu sẽrẽ a vigbete au kɔri Kirisayi rubiiyɛ a nogbeteyi pɛliviyɛ. A Kirisayi kabii nwa yuu baa aruu shɔvinaayi a shɔraayi, vi sisɨn ntanɛ, vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨng, vishonɛ a ɗɔknri, sisɨn ãnɛ a vishonɛ, rɛɛti vishonɛ, a sẽrẽ, a nyamaarinɛ, a yuu risinɛ naa rang, a ruu yeenɛ a zɔwɔyi yuu, a yuu basinɛ, a yuu roorinɛ, a Ɗa gakinɛni. Sẽkoowu nwanya ba a yuu vishonɛ pɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨng a sisɨn ãnɛni, a Kirisayi nyaba gɨnɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Tasinɛ 1.1</para>
  <para style="io1">Sisɨn ãnɛ a sẽrẽ 1.2-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Raa a Vinaa 1.9-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Ntanɛ a Sisɨn ntalinɛ 1.12-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Ntanɛ a sho a pɛlinɛ 1.19-27</para>
  <para style="io1">Lassinɛ aru nɔkãnɛ a zɔni 2.1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Sisɨn ãnɛ a vishonɛ 2. 14-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisa au rɛɛti 3.1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ a koo tipi 4.1-5.6</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyakonɛ tot-tot 5.7-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Yunɛ a Yakubu nya Ɗalapa jawɛrɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi: Nya geenɛ yɛnɛ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi a shɔ sãtiyi ɓa a koo piti kpaimiyi ɗɔbii.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sisɨn Ãnɛ a Sẽrẽ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Mazɔ̃yi ɔ zɛwɔɔ yuupɛ naa raaɓoonɛ wɔyi kanɛ tottotyɛ, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />naa ɔkɛ zɛnɛ sisɨn ãnɛ sharɔɔtɛ ɔ tɛɛ viu kakatɛ, u nya yisinɛ piti kpai ɔ maakɛ bi. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ sisɨn maanɛmkɔ yɛ n-tɔ ɗɔgbete ɔyɛ nwesi ɓayɛ, a nogbete ɔyɛ ɔ̃ shɔ vi zɛnɛ piti viwɔyɛ lɛrɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ama naa shɔwɔ ji kpaa sẽrẽɓa, u gaki Ɗa tɔ, upɛ shɔgbete yɛ ãuyɛ; aru Ɗalapa ã kopiya vi sisɨn gbete piti kpai. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ama naa ɔkɛ gaki Ɗa nɛ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ ã sisɨntɔ ɔkɔɔ bɔ̃ sisɨnnɛ. Shɔgbete kɛ bɔ̃ sisɨnnɛ u naa ɗaɗa jaa gbete a yuu mii wapo naa sɔrɔɔ kɛ shɛnɛ yɛ tuu kati u loki a ɗɔwɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ, ɔrɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨn a ɔkɔrɔɔ, ɔkɔɔ tɔnɛyi kpaa vitɔ̃vɨng wɔtɔ a Uɓeyelapa naani, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />u pɛ shɔ sisɨn bɔ̃nɛ, pɔ̃u sisɨn ɓa ɗɔgbete au vishonɛni kpai ɓa.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raa a Vinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Shɔ Kirsayi ai shɔ rayɛ iyɛ nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ aru Ɗalapa yɛ ãi binyatɔ̃nɛrɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Kirisa gbete i vinaa a ɗɔnmi, ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ i nta sisɨn purutɔ, a ɗagbete Ɗalapa kɛ risiyi shɔ raanɛ yɛ. Aruviya vinaa yɛ sɔ̃ nyatɔ naa koowalaa wati a jaa laayɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ɗa yɛ toorɛ a kakani u wati kowa laaurɛ; u koowalaa yɛ ɗɔɔrɛ, siu kɔrinɛ lɛsitɛ. Ji nyabankɔ shɔvinayi shɔyɛ lɛsirɛ a ɗagbete ikɛ yɛi ɗɔɔ vishonɛ nɛyɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn Ntanɛ a Ɗakinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Ɗalapa yɛ tasi shɔgbete i maa sisɨn ai yɛti raa ɓoonɛyɛ u susãri tɔ a biini, a ɗagbete shɔ ntai yɛtiyɛ, naa Ɗalapa kɛ shariyinɛ ikɛ tɛɛ vi sisɨn ntanɛm nɛ, iyɛ tɛ vi ɗɔnwanɛ gbete Ɗalapa maa si a shɔgbete ai ɔriuyɛtɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Naa shɔkɛ nta shɔ sisɨn nɛ a vi naam, ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ikɔ shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vi sisɨn nta nɛm shɛ pɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;Aru gbete shɔyɛ nta Ɗalapa sisɨn dɔɔɓa a vikɔ̃linɛni ɓa, u au yuu yɛ nta shɔwɔ sisɨn ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ama shɔyɛ nta shɔ sisɨntɔ a ɗagbete gbɔgbɔ vigbete shɔ kasiyɛ kɛ sɛ shɔnɛyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Kɛɗɔn iyɛ tosi jaa gbɔgbɔ vigbete i kasiyɛ i yee kɛ ruuvini; naa ruuvini kɛ banɛ yɛ yeekɛ vɔrɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Mazɔ̃yi a manayi shɔkɔɔ ɗakɔnɛǃ <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Vi ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɛ arɛ a laarɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, shɔgbete au kɔri koo lapa a ɗɔsẽsẽniyɛ, shɔgbete au kɔsi ɓa, u risi ɗɔsẽsẽ u ɔ̃ ɗɔkɨnri ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Jo au kasinɛ pɛliurɛ u ɔ̃ rɛ au karuutɔ̃vɨng, a ruugbete u kpaa ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a tete vigbete pɛliyɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntanɛ a Pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Mazɔ̃yi a manayi ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ aru vimniǃ Ɔ̃ tɛ kaka jazɨng awɔ kɔrɔɔ ɔ weshotɔ tẽẽti, ama ukɔɔ nwanyanɛ tẽẽtini, ukɔɔ lɛsi sisɨn nɛ tẽẽtini. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Shɔgbetɛ u sisɨn kɛ lɛsinɛ kpaa Ɗalapa sisɨn vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ɔ yaa nyaba vikɔ̃nlinɛ kati a nwɔvaah pɛlinɛni. Ɔ ã yuu a Ɗalapa bi ɔ tɛu ruugbete au awɔ sisɨnyɛtɔ, gbete au yɛ rauyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Ɔkɔɔ ɗakɔɔ yuunɛ nɛi weshotɔ au nyani, ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨntɔ a ɗɔɔ a pɛlinɛni. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Shɔgbete kɛ weshonɛ au ruuni ji pɛli ɓa u naa shɔgbete au kɨnnɔɔ a zɛlivini u zɛu yuurɛ jo nagbete u si ji yɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />I zɛi yuutɔ tɔ̃vɨn tiriri, i sãnyaba i yɛrɛ, i suki vigbete i zɛyɛ kati. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ama shɔgbete au kɛ kn nɔɔnɛ tiri-tiri a Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛni gbete au yɛ raa shɔyɛ, shɔgbete kɛ yɛ ɗekɨn nɛ a showenɛ aɗɔn, kɛ sukinɛ gbãgbã, ama kɛ pɛlinɛ Ɗalapa nya shanɛ nɛ tɔ̃vɨn, Ɗalapa yɛ tasiu susãritɔ a biini. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Shɔwɔ awɔ tete yɛ shakati nɛn gɨn Ɗalapa tɔ sisɨn gbete ya? A ji kɔa rɛɛtiɓa, a nyaba Ɗa gɨnnɛ lɛsitɛ a ɗaka yuutɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Vigbete Ɗalapa u Ɓeye Nyaba gɨnnɛ gbete Ɗa, Ɓeye ɔrinɛu u ɔ̃ nyaba gɨnn;e tɔ̃ɨvɨng ukɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ: u kɔ jaavɔyi a suuvɔyi ai raaɓoonɛni,u kɔu yuu sɔ̃njo a nyaba gbete ɓa tɔ̃ ɓayɛ a koo tipini.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Yusho Gɔ̃nɛ Aru Nokanɛ a Zɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Mazɔ̃yi ɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi bi, Uɓeyelapa gbete shɔ basiuyɛ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔkɛ zɛ zɔnɛ ɔkɔɔ kanɔɔnɛ aru vigbete au shɛ a wuniyɛni. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Na shɔ vinaa wɔɔ kɛ tosi saajanaa tari mɛɛnɛ a fãrã tɔ̃vɨn ni kɛ awɔ ɗɔbiinɛ awuni aɗɔgbete ɔ tolinya ɗɔnyanɛ, sɔ̃njo nankɔ shɔ raankaasɔ̃nnɛjo a fãrã sɛ̃tini a bi. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Naa ɔkɛ basi banɛ shɔgbete tosi fãrã tɔ̃vɨn abi ɔkɛ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn yɛm,&gt;&gt; ama ɔkɛ geli shɔ raamnɛ, &lt;&lt;Gisi binɛ kawaa, ko a ɔ̃nɛ yɛm a dejaam ang ɗɔɔ dɔɔm,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />kɛɗɔn siwɔɔ tasi nɔɔtɛ awɔ tetteni aru yeenɛ kɔ̃linɛni. <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />n shɔ ɔrinɛ mazɔ̃yi ɔ weshopɛ! Ɗalapa kɔ lɔɔ shɔraa gbete i a koo tipimjo i ɔ̃ shɔvinaa a yɛti sisɨn ãnɛ i kpaa Ɗalapa kpati roonɛ gbete maasi shɔgbete ai ɔriuyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ama ɔ ji bassi shɔraa ɓa! Ɓa shɔvinaakɔ tasɔɔ raa a gɔ̃ ɔrɛ a n-tɔɔ shɔ ruuyeenɛyi ɗekɨn ɓaya? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ikɔyi shavi kɔ̃linɛrɛ awɔ nii tɔ̃vɨn gbete shɔ ãwɔ wa. <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ɔyɛ pɛli ɓɛjo vitɔ̃vɨng, naa ɔkɛ gɨn Ɗa kpati roonɛ nya ãsinɛnɛ gbete shɔ kpaa a Ɗanyaruubiiyɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ ɔri ɔ shɔ nyakãsiri naa ɔ ɔrɔɔ yuuyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ama ɔkɛ tasi zɔnɔɔ kaanɛ aru vigbete shɔ tosiyɛ, a shɔ shɛ awuni si ɔ pɛli ruuvinitɛ, si ɔ ɔ̃tɛ shɔ nya ãsinɛ kanɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Shɔgbeteu kɛ kanya ãsinɛ nɛ gbete si kaitɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Aru shɔgbete wɔɔ kɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Mokɔɔ pɛli kpãngtang nɛ,&gt;&gt; u sha sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokɔɔ nyɔ yuuvɔrɔnɛ.&gt;&gt; Ama naa aji pɛli kpãngtang ɓa, akɛ nyo yuuvɔnɛ, si a ɔ̃tɛ shɔ nya ãsinɛ kanɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Aruumkɔ ɔ nwanyajo ɔ pɛlivijo nogbete yɛ tasinɛ ɔpɛ shɔgbete shɔyɛ yeerɔɔ ruujo a nya ãsinɛ gbete yɛ rauyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ama a lee ruu yeenɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ nta shɔgbete i raaɓa bini ɓa i raa ɓa; ama raanta Ɗa yɛ shariutɔ a ruu yeenɛ yuuni.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sisɨn Ãnɛ a Pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />N shɔ biyi, yɛ kɔri pikovi shɔu shanɛ nɛn sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn, ama u vishonɛ ji tasi namɓa viya? U sisɨn ãnɛ yɛ rau katiya? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Naa u ɓɛzɔ̃yi au ɓenayi ɗɔn ai kã visinbii i vishaanɛ sɔ̃m ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Naa shɔwɔ awɔ tete kɛ geliyinɛ&lt;&lt; Ɗalapa u tasɔɔ susãri biini! U ãwɔ visinbii a vishaanɛni ɔ sha tɔ̃vɨn!&gt;&gt; naa ɔji ãyi vimɓa, ɔpɛli vitɔ̃vɨng kɛpiya? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ji nankɔ a sisɨn ãnɛni: kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a yɔbũ ɓa vishonɛni ɓa, ɔ̃ kɛtɛ vɔrɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ama naa shɔwɔ yɛ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔzɛ gbete u a sisɨn ãnɛni, shɔwɔ ɓɛɛ pɛlinɛ.&gt;&gt;N ma nyakasinɛ ukɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ, &lt;&lt;Tasimpɛ a ɔ u sisɨn ãnɛ gbete u vishonɛɓa aɗɔn ɓa. N yɛn tasaa n sisɨn ãnɛ ang vishoniɛyini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />A ã tɔ̃vɨntɛ nɛ Ɗalapa gbete ya? Pɛ tɔ̃vɨn! Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ myima i ãtɔ̃vɨng tɛttɔ - a bizaanɛni. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Rang miyi! Ɔ kasinɛ shɔu tasɔɔnɛ sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa a vishonɛni ɓa pɛ weze ya? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />U ɓeuru Ibirayi ɔ̃ pikovi a Ɗalapani viya? Sijo au ruu vishonɛkɔ, a ɗagbete au ã ɓejaa Ishayaku naa viyuu ãnɛ ayuu laa zãa. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Ɔji zɛ ɓaya? U sisɨn ãnɛ a vishonɛni i shovi a nyazɔ; u sisɨn ãnɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛrɛ au kaa vishonɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />A ɗɔnkɔ shɔ yisi Ɗanyaruubii shanɛnɛ, &lt;&lt; Ibirayi ã tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗa bi, au ruu sisɨn ãnɛkɔ Ɗalapa tɛukɨn a ɔ̃ shɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨnrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Ɔ zɛtɛ ya, ji shɔ vishonɛkɔ sɨnrɛ shɔu ɔ̃rɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni, ɓa aru sisɨn ãnɛkɔ shɛɛli ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Sijo nankɔ a suu kpngtang wɔɔ shɔ ɓaunɛ Rahapini. Kpaa ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn au kaa vishonɛ, aru gbete au tɛshɔ Israila gbete i weli sho a shɔ ruukooyɛ a pɔ̃siyi naa nogbete iyɛ ranaa a nyaba wɔɔ totti. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ji nankɔ a bi gbete u ɓa suruni ɓa pɛ vɔrɔ, ji ɗɔkɔɔ a sisɨn ãnɛ gbete u vishonɛ ɓa pɛ vɔrɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Rɛɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Mazɔ̃yi a manayi ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃ shɔmalanɛ bang. Nagbete ɔ zɛtɛttɔ nɛ shɔmalayi shɔ yeeriyi ruu a nɔɔ pɔ̃sinɛni au tɛɛ shɔgãsiyi ɓɛɛtɔyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ù nijo a vipɛlinɛni piti kpai. Ama naa shɔ gbete au nii ɓɛjo au nya shanɛni ɓa, si ikɔ zɛnɔɔ ruu shanɛ ɓɛjo au kɔuyuu dɔɔtɔyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />U hãsi gbengteng saanya aru u gɨu nya, uyɛ zɛunɔɔ pɔ̃nɛtɔ u n-tiu ɗɔgbete u kasiyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Ko u kpaa sisɨn pɛ latosi: au banɛni piti kpai soro dɔ̃u a kaka shɔzaau a jaa laa saka, u yɛ ɗɔgbete shɔzaanɛu kasiyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ji nankɔ a rɛɛtini: u pẽtẽrẽ ãgugu ayuu vi pẽniba. Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ sɔ̃n pɛ a jaa laa, shɔkɛ ɓaa yaanɛ ji jaa sɔ̃sɔ̃nɔ yaa yɛ tɛti jaa laaurɛ! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Rɛɛtiu ji naa yaakɔ. Upɛ koo nyazɔ̃, au bi piti kpai u ɗɔɔ nyazɔ̃ tɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ a ɗɔnni. Jo rɛɛtikɔ sholiu sisɨn u ãlirɛ, shɔ dɔɔ rɛɛti au yuu a wɛrɛ yaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Jashɔzɛ zɛnɔɔ vivaayi yuu zaanɛ dɔɔtɔ piti kpai- vi ɓiliyi a jaanoyi, vi gɔ̃nɛ a buruyi a jazɨng ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Ama shɔwɔ ji zɛunɔɔ rɛɛti yuu gɔ̃nɛ dɔɔɓa. Upɛ vikɔ̃linɛ gbete nta shɔnya ɓa, u zɔ̃ɔpɔ̃ shɔ nyɔnɛ ɗɔn. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />U dɔ̃ri Uɓeyelapa jo a ukɔɔ a Ɓeyeni u wiri shɔ gãsiyi jo a ukɔɔ, shɔgbete Ɗalapa shɛshiyi jo au shẽbiiyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />U nwa ruu Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛjo a ukɔɔ nya gbetenkɔ shɔ wiri shɔ sɔ̃njo a ukɔɔ. Mazɔ̃yi a manayi ukɔɔ pɛlinɛ namkɔ!<verse eid="JAS 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yushɔ Gɔ̃nɛ Au Ɓɛzɔwɔ Kirisa I Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Tomii gbetenkɔ yɛ ã mii shɔ̃tinɛ kati au gãgãni ya? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Mazɔ̃yi laa sĩti yɛ rɛɛjaa laarɛti katiya ko laarɛti yɛ rɛɛjaa laa sĩti katiya? Ji nankɔ a tomii gbete u mii shɔ̃tinyatɔ yɛ shɛshi mii ntayẽ dɔɔ ɓa.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sẽrẽ Gbete Shɛ a Koo Lapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Shɔwɔ kati awɔ tetteni au kpẽnɛ ɗɔn a vizɛnɛniya? I tasi shɔpɛ ai tete ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a vishonɛni gbete au shɛ ɓa ayuu roorinɛ a sẽrẽni. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ama aa sisɨn ɓuzɨn gɨn kaanɛ ɗɔn, a lanɛni, a yuukasinɛni, si a jo maasi nyaɓa aru tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓaya? <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Sẽrẽ naa shɔm ji a ɓa lapa ɓa; ɓɛɛ koo tipi ɓɛɛ, ɓɛɛ ɓa suru ɓa, ɓɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃yi ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />A Ɗɔgbete gɨn kaanɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔn a yuukasinɛni, shɔ kpaa yuu vɔsinɛ ji ɗɔwakɔ a vikɔ̃linɛni piti kpai. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ama sẽrẽ gbete au shɛ a lapayɛ pɛ ukɔ ɗekɨn wasak; ukɔ n ti ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ rɛ, upɛ shɔ wesaa sãnɛ waanɛ, a shɔu ɔri shɔ waanɛ; nta shɔ raatɔ fɛ̃ɛ̃m, ukɔɔ n ti vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛrɛ; u ɓa shɔgbete au kanɔɔ ɓa a shɔni ɓa, pɛlivi a sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Jo nɔɔ zɔvi tɔ̃vɨnkɔ sheshi jaa tɔ̃vɨn jo a shɔ sisɨn puru i ɓaa a sisɨn puruyɛ.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Sãnɛ Wesa a Kotipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Bawaanɛ a nya marinɛni awɔ tete shɛ piya? I shɛ a vigbete ɔ kasiyɛ nɛi nta tɔ̃vɨn a wuniyɛ gbete i waaba awɔ sisɨnyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ɔ kasi vitɔ waanɛ ama ɔyɛ kpaa ɓa, aru ɔ kasi vɔrɔ nyonɛ; ɔ kã vitɔ a kakani waanɛ, ama ɔyɛ kpaa ɓa, aruukɔ ɔ marinyakɨn ɔ waabarɛ. Ɔ ji kpaa vigbete ɔ kãyɛ ɓa a ruugbete ɔji kã ɓa a Ɗalapa naa ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />A ɗagbete ɔkɛ gakinɛ ɔ kpaa ɓa aru gbete ɔ gaki ɓa a sisɨn ntɔɓa; ɔ kãvi aru gbete ɔ kasi tɔ̃vɨn ntanɛ a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ã sisɨn ɓamiyi! Ɔkɛ sã wesanɛ a kotipini ɔji zɛɓanɛ ɔpɛ Ɗalapa shɔnɔpɔ̃ ɓaya? <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Ɔkɔɔ tuunɛ mɛnɛ Ɗalapa nyaruubii tɔ̃vɨn pɛ weze gbete au shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa kagɨntɔ waanɛ aru sisɨn gbete au pɔ̃siu a yɛtiyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ama tɔ̃vɨn gbete Ɗalapa ã yɛ tɛɛ kaka tɛttɔ. Aruukɔ Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ nɛ, Ɗalapa bẽẽ yutunɛtɔ, ama ã tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ɓɛɛ shɔgbete au rooriyuyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Aruukɔ ɔ ã yuu a Ɗalapa bi. Ɔ bẽẽ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃tɔ, yɛ yuukɛkati awɔ ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ɔ aa Ɗalapani maani, ukɔma yɛ a maani a ɔkɔɔni. Ɔ shɔruuvini ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ! Ɔ shɔ yɛti ziti ɔ kɔsitɔ! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ɔ lɛsi sisɨntɔ, ɔ sĩrɛ, ɔ nte muru; ɔ kɔsi laatinɛ a sĩnɛ, ɔ binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ yɛti lɛsinɛ! <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ɔ ɓaki yuu a dii a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn, yɛ yuusɔɔ lapatɔ.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusho Gɔ̃nɛ a Ruu Yeenɛ a Zɔyuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Mazɔ̃yi, ɔkɔɔ nwanya foo nɛ a zɔ yuuni. Ɔkɛ nwanya foo nɛ a zɔ yuuni ko ɔ yeeri zɔ Kirisa ruu, si ɔ yee ruutɛ a Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ yuu. Ɔkɛ yee ruunɛ a Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ yuuni, kɛɗɔn si a toɓa shɔgbete au gɨn nya ãsinɛ ɓa, ama si akɛ shɔgbete au yeeriu ruuyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Ɗalapakɔ shɔ nya ãsinɛ ãnɛ a shɔgbete u yee ruu awuni. Ukɔ raashɔrɛ u lɛsi shɔrɛ sheli. Ɔ sĩ awɔ sisɨn nɛ ɔ piya, ɔ yeeri shɔ ruu ya?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusho Gɔ̃nɛ Aru Gūgū Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Ɔ wesho pɛ dɔdɔrim, ɔ shɔgbete ɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Nɛm ko ɓuru u yɛ yɛ komoo wɔɔ, u yɛ ɔ̃ aɗɔn saa gbete u mɛli vi u kpaa saa ɗɔrɔrɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Ɔ ji zɛ nɔgbete ɔ suru yɛ ɔ̃ yɛ ɓa! Ɔ naa miisɨi au shɛ a gadi ɗaa kɛ tanaa nɛ nirɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Vigbete ɔsi shayɛnɛ: &lt;&lt; Naa Uɓeyelapa kɛ kasinɛ, uyɛ ɔ̃rɛ a pɛli vim a viwaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ama dɔdɔrim ɔ ɗɔɔ pɛrɛ pɛlinɛ a baasinɛni; baasinɛm ɓa tɔ̃ ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Aru gbetenkɔ, ukɛ zɛnɛ u ji pɛli ɓa vitɔ̃vɨng ɓa u pɛlitɔ, aru gbete yɛ ɔ̃riurɛ ruuvini.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Yusho Gɔ̃nɛ Aru Vinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ɔ shɔ vinaamiyi, ɔ wesho ang nya! Ɔ sĩinɛ ɔ kaa nya aru vigbete au kaanɛ awɔ yuumi! <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ɔ vinaa i pntɛ pũti kpai, vimalaa mawɔ fãrã tɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ɔ tarimɛ a silivani sasa kuitɛ piti kpai, sasami ukɔɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ vi shinɛ awɔ yuuni u sha ɔ yɔpɔ bi naa yaa. Ɔ toli vi kotipimtɛ awɔ dii gbete kɛ sɔ̃nyanɛm. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ɔ ji shori shɔgbeteyi shoshɔɔ vi a jaayɛ ɓa. Ɔ weshotɔ ai ruuni! Shɔgbeteyi shoshɔɔ vi a jaayɛ i nyavɔ to Ɗalapa shotɛ, Uɓeyelapa kiriri. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ a kotipi ɔ nta tɔ̃vɨn tɛ ɔ ɗɔɔ shanɛ, ɔ ɗɔɔ ɓoonɛ. Ɔ sharɔɔ yuutɛ ɔ nɔlitɛ ɔ ɗɔgbete ɔ ga dii yeenɛyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ɔ yeeri shɔgbeteyi ruuɓa a yuuni ɓa ruutɛ yuu, ɔ nyɔi vɔrɔ sɔ̃ntɛ ama i ji kaagɨn ɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɓa.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn Mɛnɛ a Ɗalapa Gakinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Masayi ɔ ma sisɨntɔ ɔ ga ɗagbete Uɓeyelapa yɛ a yɛ. Ɔ kn nɔɔpɛ a shɔ jalanɛyi bi, nɔgbete i ma sisɨn i ga visha ai ɓaa a tipiyɛ a ɗagbete iyɛ kpaa gaanɛ mii a mii gbete yɛ kunaa nɛ nɗai visha u zɔ̃ a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨ a kɔrɔ ɔ ga sɔ̃njo. Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨntɔ a lapa feefee, aru Uɓeyelapa anɛ atɛ maani. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ɔkɔɔ nwalinyanɛ a zɔ yuuni, masayi, aru gbete Ɗalapa yɛ yeerɔ ruu ɓa yuuni ɓa. Shɔ ruu yeenɛ atɛ maani, atɛtɔ a nyejaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ masayi, a Ɗalapa jashonɛyi nya gbete i nwanya a Uɓeyelapa nii. Ɔ tuuyi naa shɔgbete i tasi yuu a tete sisɨn mɛɛnɛ a sisɨn manɛ a ɗaraa ɓoonɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />U ɓainɛ shɔbiinyatɔ̃nɛ aru gbete i ma sisɨnyɛ. Ɔ nta nɔgbete Ayuba mɛsisɨnyɛtɛ, ɔ zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ãu au yisinɛni. Aru Uɓeyelapa u shɔraa ntanɛ a shɔ-shɔruuvini yasinɛni a mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />A vigbete tɛɛ shɔmni piti kpai, ɔkɔɔ shovinɛ a teenɛni a ruuvigbete ɔ maayɛni. Ɔkɔɔ teenɛ a kolapani ko a kotipini ko a viwɔni kɔgbete. Ɔ shajinɛ &lt;&lt;Nn&gt;&gt;kɔshɛɛli nɗa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nizɛyɛ, ko &lt;&lt;Ɓa&gt;&gt;nɗa ji ɔ̃ ɓa nizɛ ɓayɛ, aru ɔyɛ to Ɗalapa ruu yeenɛrɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Shɔwɔ kati awɔ teteni u yuyɔrinɛ a ɗɔnya? Shɔwɔ kati awɔ tete u binyatɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔniya? I tɔ̃ɔ̃ soo bɛlinɛtɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Shɔwɔ kati awɔ tete u vɔrɔya? See u ɓa yupɛ̃ni jaaɗayi nyatɔ, shɔgbete yɛ gaki Ɗa ai yuu ɗau sɔ̃riyinɔɔ ai bi au Uɓeyelapa nii. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ɗa gbete shɔ gaki shɔ vɔrɔm a tete sisɨn ãnɛ yɛ gatiutɔ; Uɓeyelapa yɛ gatiyitɔ, i ruuvini gbete i pɛliyɛ Ɗalapa yɛ yasiyitɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Aruukɔ ɔ geli zɔ ruuvini ɔ yasi zɔ tɔ, ɔ gaki zɔ Ɗa tɔ, a nɔgbete shɔyɛ gati ɔyɛ. Shɔ tɔ̃vɨn Ɗa gakinɛ u kaka ɗɔn. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iliya u sijo shɔzɛ naa ukɔɔ. Ã sisɨntɔ a Ɗa gakinɛni waanɛ nɛ mii kɔ anɛ, mii ji a ɓa a tipiuni ɓa saa taati au ɗiiti. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Au kɨnti ni gaki Ɗa sɔ̃n tot, koyãsi ã miirɛ vishatarɛ a tipiuni. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Masayi naa shɔwɔkɛ yaa nyaba nizɛ nɛ, shɔwɔkɛ sɔriu sɔ̃nɛ, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ a vimni: shɔgbetekɛ sɔri shɔruuvininɛ au nyaba kɔ̃linɛuni yɛ raa shɔruuviniu surutɔ a vɔnɛni, shɔmkɔ yɛ ɔ̃ nyaba ruuvini waanɛ yasinɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>